* SKY130 schematic-characterized proposal; not layout-qualified.
* MOS W/L below are micrometres; use .option scale=1e-6 in testbench.
* m is explicit parallel multiplicity; nf=1. MOS dimensions preserved; physical R/C compensation documented in source.json.
.subckt two_stage_ota vinp vinn vout ibias vdd vss
XMNBIAS ibias ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=3 l=1 m=1 nf=1
